<title>DENMARK: Danish Nov wholesale prices up 1.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish Nov wholesale prices up 1.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices fell by 0.3 percent in November from October but were up 1.1 percent from November 1995, the national statistics office said on Friday.  </p>
<p>					Nov 1996  Oct 1996   Nov 1995</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)    -0.3    +0.2	    0.0</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)     +1.1    +1.4	   +1.7</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100)  104.1    104.4	 103.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
</text>
